ents continuously reconcile transactions and balances pulled from your ERP. By close, most of the work is already done — and your team is focused on real exceptions, not routine matching.",[],{"alt":9,"altText":9,"asset":617,"bgColor":619,"caption":9,"dimensions":620,"lqip":622,"originalFilename":623},{"_ref":618,"_type":13},"image-7d036c2bc7b62c28f8dc2b5ee1f911026972fc9d-72x72-svg","#ecdc8c",{"_type":16,"aspectRatio":17,"height":621,"width":621},72,"data:image\u002Fjpeg;base64,\u002F9j\u002F2wBDAAYEBQYFBAYGBQYHBwYIChAKCgkJChQODwwQFxQYGBcUFhYaHSUfGhsjHBYWICwgIyYnKSopGR8tMC0oMCUoKSj\u002F2wBDAQcHBwoIChMKChMoGhYaKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCj\u002FwAARCAAUABQDASIAAhEBAxEB\u002F8QAFwABAQEBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYHBf\u002FEACMQAAEEAgEDBQAAAAAAAAAAAAEAAgMFBAYRBxIhExQxYZH\u002FxAAXAQEBAQEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAIG\u002F8QAGREBAQEBAQEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEDAjFx\u002F9oADAMBAAIRAxEAPwDYthuMWhqZ7GwcW40I5cQOSp3Weo9Lsdq3Ar\u002FcGVzS4OdGQP1dXe8QZurZ0Bwjnct5GOHcd5H2oDT5tnn2uq9WhFVUwxGOQDg93jx5+VzOefHWdt9+rLbK15ERTNiIiAiIg\u002F\u002FZ","Replace Arrows - Yellow.svg","Continuous reconciliation on top of your ERP","text",{"_key":627,"blockText":628,"icon":637,"title":644,"type":625},"b9c94fd61f18",[629],{"_key":630,"_type":435,"children":631,"markDefs":636,"style":452},"7e63ebd07c08",[632],{"_key":633,"_type":439,"marks":634,"text":635},"62db1a138054",[],"Nominal monitors balance movements and unmatched transactions as they happen. When something looks off, agents flag it and initiate follow-up workflows — turning your ERP from a static ledger into a dynamic control environment.",[],{"alt":9,"altText":9,"asset":638,"bgColor":640,"caption":9,"dimensions":641,"lqip":642,"originalFilename":643},{"_ref":639,"_type":13},"image-44920bb7986ea80d984d04240a7d9142f15d0c90-72x72-svg","#b4c4f4",{"_type":16,"aspectRatio":17,"height":621,"width":621},"data:image\u002Fjpeg;base64,\u002F9j\u002F2wBDAAYEBQYFBAYGBQYHBwYIChAKCgkJChQODwwQFxQYGBcUFhYaHSUfGhsjHBYWICwgIyYnKSopGR8tMC